#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""
batch_bigmask_contact_vertical_lines_planes.py

Big-mask-only contact-touch vertical-lines / planes.

For each frame:
  1) load and project the scene cloud
  2) run SAM3, keep only big masks
  3) if a big mask has disconnected pieces, keep only its largest connected component
  4) build the 4 big-mask corner rays
  5) for each ray, find the closest scene contact point within 1 meter of the ray
  6) only keep masks with at least 2 touching rays (equivalently, do not keep masks with 3+ non-touching rays)
  7) for every touching ray of a surviving mask, make one vertical line using that contact XY and the ray vertical height
  8) form planes from every combination of those vertical lines

Outputs per frame:
  scene_cloud_frameXXXXXX.ply
  big_mask_all_rays_frameXXXXXX.ply
  big_mask_surviving_rays_frameXXXXXX.ply
  big_mask_planes_frameXXXXXX.ply
  big_mask_debug_overlay_frameXXXXXX.jpg
  inference_timing_frameXXXXXX.csv
"""



